  "notes": "Fixes background bleed-through when Use Header is enabled. The header is now an opaque independent surface, so the main page background image cannot continue through the header area. Adds a Header Background Color control; the header uses only that color and its own header image/GIF, while the main background remains below it. Exported AO3 CSS now overrides the older continuous-background rule for the header."
